'''The Overflowing Chalice''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Sulphur Flask}}.
{{Item acquisition}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 5.50 seconds instead.

==Legacy variants==
The Overflowing Chalice has a [[legacy variant]]:

{{legacy variant table header}}
{{legacy variant table row|3.15.0|Creates Consecrated Ground on Use|
* {{c|mod|50% increased Charge Recovery}}
* {{c|mod|(10-20)% increased Duration}}
* Gains no Charges during Effect of any Overflowing Chalice Flask
* {{c|mod|100% increased Charges gained by Other Flasks during Flask Effect}}
}}
{{Legacy variant table end}}

